  "ingredients": [
    "2 large sweet potatoes, cut into 1-inch cubes",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "2 tablespoons brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon ground cumin",
    "0.25 teaspoon cayenne pepper, or more to taste",
    "salt and pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KfDJjCpFffq_zUPGQzVcrX0GpKw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-214743-grilled-sweet-potatoes-VAT-step-01-f4f228e986cf4f92aa648ec2c086de81.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214743/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide sweet potato cubes in half, and place each half in the center of a rectangle of aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nsxfLSjSwR75yJjKD8tIA_dg2PU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-214743-grilled-sweet-potatoes-VAT-step-02-d3571b13936844a2be83411be246552e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214743/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top each portion with about half of the butter. Sprinkle about half of the brown sugar, cumin, and cayenne pepper over each portion. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e6UN7O4fe7-jRcT8fP2SzwxWRqw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-214743-grilled-sweet-potatoes-VAT-step-03-cce389dbf045403fa2cd15f203ac8000.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214743/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold the corners of the aluminum foil together and seal to form a pouch around each portion.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yBbfT3-96LniS5Voymd2NCjSnHo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-214743-grilled-sweet-potatoes-VAT-step-04-76a63952a9d0422f867fd723eb2ae301.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214743/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook on the preheated grill, turning pouches every 10 minutes, until the potatoes are golden, tender, and cooked through, 20 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1WVDiCDMNG7pVWa3upLsPRhkSGg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-214743-grilled-sweet-potatoes-VAT-step-05-fe11f0aa9d974b2294695c68a84fea36.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/214743/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
